/-!
# B-line IL, source-table producers, part 4: `ljP`, the backward pass

State after `k` backward steps (`m = s - k` positions left, the next one `j = m - 1`): `14` holds
the forward starts of `0, …, m-1` (last first) over the sentinel, `15` the block end
`ncv m = eB (m-1)`, and `30, 31, 32, 33` the outputs on positions `m, …, s-1`.
-/

